            <button data-act="cetak" data-id="${r.id}" class="text-xs font-semibold text-white bg-gold-500 hover:bg-gold-600 rounded px-3 py-1.5">Cetak</button>
            <button data-act="edit" data-id="${r.id}" class="text-xs font-semibold text-navy border border-navy-200 hover:bg-navy-50 rounded px-3 py-1.5 ml-1">Edit</button>
            <button data-act="hapus" data-id="${r.id}" class="text-xs font-semibold text-rust border border-rust/30 hover:bg-rust-100 rounded px-3 py-1.5 ml-1">Hapus</button>
          </div>
        </li>`).join('')}</ul>`
      : `<p class="text-sm text-navy-300 py-2">Belum ada SK tersimpan. Klik <b>Simpan SK</b> atau <b>Cetak</b> — SK otomatis masuk daftar ini.</p>`}
